      m_Calls: []
  m_text: Every truck has three huge tethered balloons. Drive, dodge and aim your
    roof-mounted retractable spike at an opponent's balloons. ACTION arms a yellow
    quarter-second warning, then a red 0.6-second attack. Cyan means ready; purple
    means the 2.5-second cooldown is still running. Actual spike-to-balloon contact
    is required. One attack can pop at most one balloon on each opponent. Ordinary
    body bumps, proximity and AI decisions never award points. +1 per pop, +3 for
    eliminating an opponent, +5 for sole survival. Lose all three and a confetti
    burst sends you to a spectator camera. Simultaneous mutual final pops are a draw.
    Difficulty changes actual AI driving/attack decisions, never free damage. Shared
    arena, independent chase/cab views, free look, optional AI views, crew names/colors,
    selectable weather and the universal horn use the collection controls. Slow or
    overturned trucks automatically recover at a separated safe point; this never
    restores balloons. Match-end recorded replay cannot change the result.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
